I sit at my table.
I have a notebook and a pen in my hand.
I start the Kande Pohe cooking video again.
I want to bring groceries from the market.
I listen to the video carefully.
In the video the chef says, "First take half a kilo of thick poha."
I write 'half a kilo of thick poha' in the notebook.
Then she says, "After that take a quarter kilo of onions."
I add onions to the list.
The chef says next, "Now take some peanuts."
Peanuts taste very nice in poha.
So I write 'one bowl of peanuts' on the list.
Then she talks about the spices.
"Use two spoons of mustard seeds and one spoon of turmeric," she says.
I look in my kitchen.
I already have turmeric and mustard seeds.
Therefore, I do not write them on the list.
Now my shopping list is ready.
I take a bag and leave to go to the shop.
